{"pageid": 752, "title": "James's father", "revid": 1723, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "Children", "Archer's Peak", "Unnamed characters", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">James' father</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/38/JamesFather.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215171356\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"JamesFather\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/38/JamesFather.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215171356\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/38/JamesFather.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215171356 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/38/JamesFather.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241215171356 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"JamesFather\" width=\"270\" height=\"197\" data-image-key=\"JamesFather.png\" data-image-name=\"JamesFather.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alive</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unnamed estranged wife<br /><p>Unnamed daughter<br /><a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a> <small>(son)</small><br /></p></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #1</a> <small>(voicemail)</small></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_11\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 11\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #11</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>James' father</b> lives in <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak, Wisconsin</a> with his <a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">son</a>, whom he struggled to protect his son during the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak incident (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX2luY2lkZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak incident</span>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>James's Father was the parent to an unnamed daughter and James. He and the children's mother were separated,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC15&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC15-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> with the children living with him in <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak, Wisconsin</a>. He is often busy at work or taking James's sister to sporting events.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC1&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC1-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>While James had a sleepover with his friends, James's father slept upstairs until hearing loud noises outside. He went out to scold the boys for making noise, only to find a bloody James surrounded by the torn-apart bodies of his friends. Terrified, James's father hugged him and asked what had done this; a tearful James said it was him.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC11&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC11-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>James would later be questioned by police, but let go as the attack was thought to be from an animal. The family would temporarily move into a hotel to avoid media attention, but James's father would have to work long hours, often leaving James alone. He did call his son every day to ensure his safety, however.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC1&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC1-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>After the arrest of <a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a>, James would stay with his mother in Milwaukee for a while.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC15&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC15-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>James's father is only briefly seen. He has the same black hair and brown eyes as his son, and a similar Caucasian skintone. His hairline is receding, and he is drawn with arm and leg hair.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC11&#95;3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC11-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\">Personality</span></h2>\n<p>Little is known about James's father. He seems to care deeply for his son, running to him when he's in danger<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC11&#95;3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC11-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> and often checking up on him after the traumatic event. He moved the family into a hotel room in order to avoid press following the deaths of James's friends, and called James often when walking home from school. He is often working and seems well-off financially, as they have a large home.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC1&#95;2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC1-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>He often calls James by a nickname, either \"Jimmy\"<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC1&#95;2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC1-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> or \"Jamie.\"<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC11&#95;3-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC11-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\">Issue #1</a> <small>(voicemail)</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_11\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 11\">Issue #11</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<small><div style=\"width:auto; max-height:190px; overflow:auto; padding-left:0.5em; padding-right:0.5em; border-top-left-radius:0.5em; border-bottom-left-radius:0.5em\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC15-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC15_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC15_1-1\">1.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/A_Game_of_Nowhere_(comic_arc)\" title=\"A Game of Nowhere (comic arc)\">vol. #3</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_15\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 15\">issue no. 15</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2021.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC1-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC1_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC1_2-1\">2.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC1_2-2\">2.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC1_2-3\">2.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Angel_of_Archer%27s_Peak_(comic_arc)\" title=\"The Angel of Archer&#39;s Peak (comic arc)\">vol. #1</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\">issue no. 1</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2019.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC11-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC11_3-0\">3.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC11_3-1\">3.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC11_3-2\">3.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC11_3-3\">3.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/A_Game_of_Nowhere_(comic_arc)\" title=\"A Game of Nowhere (comic arc)\">vol. #3</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_11\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 11\">issue no. 11</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2020.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div></small></div>", "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T22:43:14+00:00"}